        {
          "comments": "NOT REVIEWED — raw running config supplied for manual review; no automated pass, finding, or applicability decision asserted.",
          "finding_details": "Raw running config SHA-256: 3f6fc46dd5f94ef654b685b11fbb64f0700bb78e8da3dba9fcb55525915202d0\nOfficial Cisco benchmark SHA-256: e0dd8c7bf54a46474d09cc23186d5a7c12d883421d2c187fc8025d4ddbf0297f\nRunning config alone does not verify this control's complete operational check; manual review required.",
          "fix_text": "Configure the switch to authenticate all VLAN Trunk Protocol (VTP) messages with a hash function using a configured password as shown in the example below:\n\nSW1(config)#vtp password xxxxxxxxx",
